1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,740
5 words to never say in productivity.

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:12,270
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say multitask, instead say batch - because people batching

3
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,900
actually finishes.

4
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:20,770
Don't say work harder, instead say work smarter - effort isn't the edge.

5
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:26,710
Don't say stay busy, instead say stay focused - busy is a trap.

6
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:33,440
Don't say discipline, instead say routine - discipline fades, routine holds.

7
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:40,480
Don't say more hours, instead say better blocks - hours don't scale, focus does.

8
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:45,080
Your productivity does not have to sound like everyone else's.

9
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:49,150
Comment 'EDGE' and I will send you the full list.

10
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:53,530
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
